One thing I noticed in your practice
You made this mistake:

C:\Git Learn clone>git status
fatal: not a git repository

That's actually a good mistake.

You were in:

C:\Git Learn clone

but the repository was:

C:\Git Learn clone\git-demo-learn

Git commands operate inside a Git repository (or an appropriate subdirectory of one).

So:

C:\Git Learn clone
        ❌
        
C:\Git Learn clone\git-demo-learn
        ✅

That's exactly the kind of mistake you want to encounter while learning.

